const char *const text_pages[] = {
"THE BELLS OF THE UNDERTOWN\nHAVE GONE QUIET.",
"WITHOUT THEM THE CITY FORGETS\nITSELF, ONE STREET AT A TIME.",
"IN A DUSTY LOFT, A SMALL\nWARDEN IN A KITE-SHAPED MASK\nOPENS ITS EYES. ITS NAME IS",
"MENUEL.",
"OH! YOU ARE AWAKE, MENUEL.\nGOOD. I AM TOO OLD TO CLIMB.",
"FOUR BELLS KEEP THIS PLACE\nALIVE. SOMETHING HAS STOLEN\nTHEIR VOICES.",
"TAKE YOUR AXE. WAKE THE BELLS.\nSTART IN THE SALT MINES, DOWN\nTHE STAIR.",
"THE LANTERNS STILL BURN. REST\nBY ONE AND IT WILL REMEMBER\nYOU.",
"PRESS UP TO USE IT. THE LOWER\nSCREEN SHOWS WHERE YOU HAVE\nBEEN.",
"I HEARD IT! A BELL! FAINT, BUT\nTRUE. KEEP GOING, LITTLE\nWARDEN.",
"MIND YOUR HEAD. THE FOREMAN\nSTILL WORKS HIS SHIFT, AND HE\nDOES NOT KNOW HE IS DEAD.",
"HIS PIT LIES ACROSS THE BROKEN\nSPAN. NO ONE JUMPS THAT FAR.",
"BUT THERE IS A SHRINE LEFT OF\nHERE. THE OLD ONES LEFT A GIFT\nFOR FAST FEET.",
"THE SPAN IS UP THE SHAFT AND\nTO THE RIGHT. PRESS R IN THE\nAIR TO RUSH.",
"NAME? DATE OF DROWNING? NO?\nTHEN I CANNOT HELP YOU. SORRY.\nHABIT.",
"THE BELFRY FLOODED YEARS AGO.\nTHE ROPE MEN NEVER LET GO OF\nTHEIR ROPES.",
"BELOW THE ROPE WALK THERE IS A\nHOOK FOR THOSE WHO MUST CROSS\nTHE BELLS.",
"ANCHOR RINGS HOLD A HOOK.\nPRESS L NEAR ONE. FILE THAT\nUNDER USEFUL.",
"HAH. THAT AXE IS DULL AND YOU\nSWING IT LIKE A BROOM.",
"TAKE WHAT LIES ON MY ANVIL.\nHOLD DOWN AND STRIKE WHILE\nFALLING.",
"CRACKED FLOORS WILL GIVE WAY.\nMY TWO BROTHERS ARE BELOW. WE\nSHARE ONE APRON.",
"THERE IS A CRACKED FLOOR PAST\nTHE SCRAP TOWER. FALL HARD AND\nSTRIKE.",
"SHH. UP HERE WE KEEP THE\nQUIET. IT IS ALL THAT IS LEFT.",
"THE RINGER TOOK THE VOICES SO\nTHAT NOTHING WOULD HURT ANY\nMORE.",
"IT MEANT WELL. THAT IS THE\nWORST OF IT. TAKE THE CLOAK.\nTHE WIND WILL LIFT YOU TWICE.",
"JUMP AGAIN IN THE AIR. THE\nLAST BELL HANGS ABOVE THE HIGH\nSHELF.",
"A: JUMP. B: AXE. HOLD A TO\nJUMP HIGHER.",
"EACH HIT FILLS YOUR ECHO. HOLD\nX ON SOLID GROUND TO TURN ECHO\nINTO HEALTH.",
"DOWN: DROP THROUGH A LEDGE.\nSTART: PAUSE.",
"SHIFT LOG: DAY 9,114. THE BELL\nHAS STOPPED. WORK CONTINUES.",
"THE WATER ROSE WITHOUT A\nSOUND. NOTHING HERE MAKES A\nSOUND NOW.",
"WE CAST THE LAST BELL HERE. WE\nGAVE IT NO TONGUE. IT WAS TOLD\nTO WAIT.",
"WHEN ALL IS RINGING, WHO WILL\nLISTEN? WHEN ALL IS QUIET, WHO\nWILL HURT?",
"YOU FOUND THE RUSH. PRESS R TO\nDART FORWARD, ON THE GROUND OR\nIN THE AIR.",
"YOU FOUND THE HOOK. PRESS L\nNEAR AN ANCHOR RING TO PULL\nYOURSELF TO IT.",
"YOU FOUND THE CLEAVE. HOLD\nDOWN AND PRESS B IN THE AIR TO\nCRASH DOWN AND BREAK CRACKED",
"FLOORS.",
"YOU FOUND THE CLOAK OF WIND.\nPRESS A IN THE AIR TO JUMP\nAGAIN.",
"A BELL SHARD. IT HUMS IN YOUR\nHANDS. MAXIMUM HEALTH UP.",
"A WHETSTONE. THE AXE BITES\nTWICE AS DEEP.",
"SHIFT... NOT... OVER.",
"THE ROPE... MUST NOT...\nSLACKEN.",
"WHO COMES? A CUSTOMER! NO,\nBROTHER. A THIEF! THEN WE MELT\nIT.",
"THE ANVIL STANDS ALONE. IT HAS\nWAITED A LONG TIME TO BE\nSTRUCK.",
"LITTLE ONE. PUT IT DOWN.\nLISTEN. ISN'T THE QUIET KIND?",
"SOMEWHERE FAR ABOVE, THE FIRST\nBELL BEGINS TO RING.",
"THE ROPE GOES SLACK. THE\nSECOND BELL ANSWERS THE FIRST.",
"THE BROTHERS FALL QUIET, AND\nFOR ONCE THEY AGREE. THE WAY\nON IS OPEN.",
"THE ANVIL SPLITS. THE THIRD\nBELL SOUNDS THROUGH THE IRON.\nTHE WAY UP IS OPEN.",
"THE RINGER LAYS DOWN ITS\nHANDS. THE LAST BELL HANGS IN\nFRONT OF YOU, SILENT.",
"MENUEL TAKES THE AXE AND\nSTRIKES THE BELL ITSELF.",
"THE NOTE ROLLS DOWN THE\nMOUNTAIN, THROUGH IRON AND\nWATER AND SALT.",
"ALL ACROSS THE UNDERTOWN,\nPEOPLE REMEMBER THEIR NAMES.",
"THE LITTLE WARDEN SITS DOWN\nAND LISTENS FOR A WHILE.",
};
